[15.634, "o", "\r\n"]
[15.684, "o", "The moment the ground moves, Drop, Cover, and Hold On. Drop to your hands and knees, take\r\n"]
[15.734, "o", "cover under a sturdy table, and hold on until the shaking stops. Stay away from windows and\r\n"]
[15.784, "o", "anything that can fall on you. Do not run outside while the ground is still moving.\r\n"]
